This directory contains CPU-architecture-specific code.

Note that a CPU architecture may be shared among one or more
Embedded Xinu "platforms" (see ../platforms/ ).

Nothing here is compiled directly: SYSCOMPS only covers system/,
system/platforms/$(PLATFORM) and loader/, so each reusable file has a
one-line twin in the platform directory that #includes it (see
system/platforms/esp32p4/ctxsw.S).  Code that touches this SoC's
registers has no twin here and lives only in the platform directory:
riscvclk.c (CLINT mtime/mtimecmp, which on RV32 must be read and written
as two 32-bit words), clic.c, platforminit.c and irqentry.S.
